vity><witsml:comments>Performed TBT for installing bore protector.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-29T11:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-29T13:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- bop/wellhead equipment</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Removed master bushings. M/U running tool and bore protector. RIH on 5 1/2&quot; DP and installed boreprotector. POOH with running tool. R/B DP stand and installed master bushings.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-29T13:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-29T13:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>drilling -- casing</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed TBT for running Timelock plug.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-29T13:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-29T15:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">45</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>drilling -- casing</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>P/U Timelock plug, RIH with same on 5 1/2&quot; DP to 45 m. Installed diverter inserts.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-29T15:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-29T17:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">369</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>drilling -- casing</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>RIH w/Timelock plug on 5 7/8&quot;  DP from 45 m to 369 m. Avg. tripping speed 162 m/hr.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-29T17:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-29T17:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">369</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>drilling -- casing</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed TBT for washing down and setting plug.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-29T17:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-29T18:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">395</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>drilling -- casing</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Continued RIH from 369 m to 395 m. Lined up to wash top of PBR, verified line up against closed IBOP. Bled off pressure.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-29T18:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-29T18:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">395</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>drilling -- casing</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Started to pump drill water at 300 lpm. Increased rate to 1100 lpm / 0 bar and washed top of PBR.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-29T18:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-29T20:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">395</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>operation failed</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Attempted to set Timelock plug according to Archer procedures. Made 3 attempts without sucess. Archer rep contacted onshore support for advice. Performed TBT with new crew. Observed that the plug was not at the required setting depth - attempted set in 13 3/8&quot; casing. RIH with Timelock plug from 395 m to 424 m.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-29T20:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-29T21:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">425.6</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>drilling -- casing</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Washed plug setting area and sat Timelock plug according to Archer instructions. Top of plug at 420,8 m. Positive indication of plug set. Closed ball valve and applied 30 bar to verify same closed. P/U and released running tool from plug.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-29T21:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-29T22:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">415</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>drilling -- casing</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Lined up over shakers. Started pumping drill water from rig pumps. Increased pump rate to 2100 lpm / 0 bar and circulated 1 BU.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-29T22:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-29T23:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">415</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>drilling -- casing</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Lined up cement unit to drillstring and performed line test against TDS IBOP to 100 bar. Bled back to 10 bar and opened TDS IBOP to confirm line-up.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-29T23:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-29T23:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">415</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>drilling -- casing</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Closed overboard valves. Lined up rig pumps and pumped drill water down string and up above diverter packer. Closed diverter packer. Line up to cement unit and attempted to pressure up well to 10 bar from cement unit. No success.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-29T23:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-30T00:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">415</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>operation failed</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Checked line up and troubleshot loss of pressure.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity>
